id: VER13-5
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: ir_refusal_host
features: test-hooks
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:                     Err(e) => self.ir_refusal = Some(e.reason_code()),
replace:                     Err(e) => self.ir_refusal = Some(e.reason_code()).filter(|_| false),
expect-fail: refused_ir_at_runtime_keeps_the_session
note: 起動後に読めない IR を断ったとき理由コードを控えない（断りが観察できない）
